WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:03,310
I want this guest

2
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:05,750
This brand is sold out. You can check it out.

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,390
Can you disassemble this?

4
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:09,070
This is sold whole

5
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,390
I have no right to take it apart

6
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:11,950
I said I wanted to wrap it up

7
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,790
You open this big package

8
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:15,590
I need to meet weird purchase requirements

9
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:16,990
Sell the goods smoothly

10
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:18,870
But I can't destroy the property in the store without permission

11
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:21,030
And the goods record must be consistent with the goods

12
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:24,550
Once you unpack the two items, the quantities won’t match up. Sorry.

13
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:25,990
This brand is sold out

14
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,830
Guests, you can look at other brands

15
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:31,460
I said take it apart

16
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:35,460
I can't control myself anymore, it's weird

17
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:40,050
This weird thing wants to control me and break the rules. Who can save me?

18
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:44,180
People will encounter this weird thing that can control the human body.

19
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:45,970
Nothing is right

20
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:49,260
All cried

21
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:52,110
Why do you still have to embarrass your guest?

22
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:53,470
It's time for our shift change

23
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:54,910
maybe something you need

24
00:00:54,910 --> 00:00:56,710
It will be re-listed during the evening shift

25
00:00:57,070 --> 00:00:58,190
Please come at another time

26
00:00:58,750 --> 00:01:01,070
During shift time, we have to close the door temporarily for cleaning.
